Write a C function to initialize and populate a dynamic array of `TrafficFlowStatistics` structures from multiple network interfaces. Each structure should include fields for `flowId`, `trafficVolumeInBytes`, and `packetDrops`. Your function should handle up to 10 simultaneous network interfaces and process data in real-time. Consider using multi-threading to manage concurrent data processing and ensure thread safety.

Design Challenges:
